## Self-Learning

Local-only learning log: `core/LEARNINGS.md` (triggers and the Repeats metric are
described there). Who may change which file -- the access zones table in
`tools/TOOLS.md`.

1. Event -> classify type (tool / behavior / workflow / architecture)
2. Record in core/LEARNINGS.md (structured log)
3. Record in auto-memory feedback_*.md if behavioral
4. If stable pattern -> propose a rule for core/rules.md; add it once the operator agrees
